      {% if benchmarks.toolMedians.fastest == 'basilisk' %}<h2 class="feature-row__title">The fastest checker<br>we&rsquo;ve benchmarked.</h2>{% else %}<h2 class="feature-row__title">Faster than Pyright.<br>Every construct we benchmark.</h2>{% endif %}
